  "text_nho": {
   "sherbrooke_annotations/ReadMe.txt": "################################################English################################################\r\nAnnotation of the Sherbrooke video (format Polytrack)\r\nThe video annotated from frame 2754 to 3754\r\nFile\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\r\nsherbrooke_gt.sqlite \t\t\t\tThe annotation of all road users in the video defined by a a mask.\r\nsherbrooke_gt_cars.sqlite \t\t\tThe annotation of all cars in the video defined by a a mask.\r\nsherbrooke_gt_pedestrians.sqlite \tThe annotation of all pedestrians users in the video defined by a a mask.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.jpjodoin.com/urbantracker/\r\n\r\nMetrics tool must be use with ABSDIST 90 to compare with:\r\nJodoin, J.-P., Bilodeau, G.-A., Saunier, N., Urban Tracker: Multiple Object Tracking in Urban Mixed Traffic, Accepted for IEEE Winter conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV14), Steamboat Springs, Colorado, USA, March 24-26, 2014 \r\n\r\n\r\nChange list:\r\nJanuary 6th 2015:\r\nA missing bounding box was added at frame 3307 for the object number 2\r\n\r\n\r\n################################################Fran�ais################################################\r\nAnnotations de la sc�ne Sherbrooke (format Polytrack)\r\nLa vid�o a �t� annot�e de la trame 2754 � la trame 3754 inclusivement\r\nFichier\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\r\nsherbrooke_gt.sqlite \t\t\t\tL'annotation de l'ensemble des objets de la sc�ne tel que d�fini par un masque\r\nsherbrooke_gt_cars.sqlite \t\t\tL'annotation de l'ensemble des v�hicules de la sc�ne tel que d�fini par un masque\r\nsherbrooke_gt_pedestrians.sqlite \tL'annotation de l'ensemble des pi�tons de la sc�ne tel que d�fini par un masque\r\n\r\n\r\nChangements:\r\n6 janvier 2015\r\nUne boite englobante manquante a �t� ajout� � la trame 3307 pour l'objet num�ro 2\r\n"
